  "worked_solution": "Since $∠N$ is a null and a right angle, we have\n\n$$\nm∠N={0}^{∘}\n$$\n\nand since $∠S$ is a straight angle, we have\n\n$$\nm∠S={180}^{∘}.\n$$\n\nSo, their sum is \n\n$$\nm∠N+m∠S={0}^{∘}+{180}^{∘}={180}^{∘}.\n$$\n\nConsequently, the sum of $∠N$ and $∠S$ is a straight angle.",
